WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,620
These bastards are doing it again

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:07,780
Chase me and try to keep people in Omae territory.

3
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:16,920
Is it possible to pursue it like this?

4
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,200
What can be done

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,200
No one of us is afraid of a head-on confrontation.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,200
But after the opponent suffered several head-on losses,

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,200
Let’s switch to this way of playing

8
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,780
Can't you set up an ambush in advance?

9
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,780
Advance How to Advance

10
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,780
The opponent randomly takes time to attack

11
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:37,780
And our camp is the only one nearby.

12
00:00:37,780 --> 00:00:40,780
We can't unite with the rest of the camp to help us pursue them.

13
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,810
We can only put it off again and again.

14
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:46,470
Head, what are you going to play again this time?

15
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,470
Could it be that you want to take advantage of this canyon?

16
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:56,190
These barbarians want to take advantage of the terrain to take a bite out of them

17
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,190
It's a pity that they counted me as a variable.
